{'symbol': 'MCK', 'date': '2022-01-18 17:10:00', 'title': "MCKESSON'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTS JAMES H. HINTON AND KATHLEEN WILSON-THOMPSON AS NEW DIRECTORS", 'text': "IRVING, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MCKESSON CORPORATION (NYSE: MCK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE MCKESSON BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTED JAMES H. HINTON AND KATHLEEN WILSON-THOMPSON AS DIRECTORS ON JAN. 13, 2022. MCKESSON EXPECTS THAT THE BOARD WILL APPOINT HINTON TO THE COMPLIANCE COMMITTEE AND GOVERNANCE COMMITTEE AND WILSON-THOMPSON TO THE COMPENSATION COMMITTEE AND GOVERNANCE COMMITTEE. WITH THE ELECTION OF HINTON AND WILSON-THOMPSON, MCKESSON'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS INCREASES FROM 9 TO 11 MEMBERS. “WE'R"}